"gates/extracted-outputs/6b812497-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/fractional-"
"gates/extracted-outputs/6b812497-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We first transpile the circuit for a backend that does not support "
"fractional gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Una, iti-transpile natin ang circuit para sa backend na hindi sumusuporta sa"
" fractional gates.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
