# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then, we transpile the same circuit using fractional RX gates, while excluding RZZ gates.\n"
"This results in a slight reduction in the total gate count, thanks to the more efficient implementation of the RX gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos, iti-transpile natin ang parehong circuit gamit ang fractional RX gates, habang inaalisan ang RZZ gates.\n"
"Ito ay nagreresulta sa bahagyang pagbawas sa kabuuang gate count, salamat sa mas epektibong implementasyon ng RX gates.\n"

