"Optimize U gates with fractional RX gates {#optimize-u-gates-with-"
"fractional-rx-gates}"
msgstr ""
"I-optimize ang U gates gamit ang fractional RX gates {#optimize-u-gates-"
"with-fractional-rx-gates}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this section, we demonstrate how to optimize U gates using fractional RX "
"gates, building on the same circuit introduced in the previous section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa seksyong ito, ipapakita natin kung paano i-optimize ang U gates gamit ang"
" fractional RX gates, na binuo sa parehong circuit na ipinakilala sa "
"nakaraang seksyon.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You will need to install the `qiskit-basis-constructor` [package](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-basis-constructor) for this section.\n"
"This is a beta version of a new transpilation plugin for Qiskit, which might be integrated into Qiskit in the future.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kakailanganin ninyong i-install ang `qiskit-basis-constructor` [package](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-basis-constructor) para sa seksyong ito.\n"
"Ito ay beta version ng bagong transpilation plugin para sa Qiskit, na maaaring isama sa Qiskit sa hinaharap.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We transpile the circuit using only fractional RX gates, excluding RZZ gates.\n"
"By introducing a custom decomposition rule, as shown in the following,\n"
"we can reduce the number of single-qubit gates required to implement a U gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Iti-transpile natin ang circuit gamit lamang ang fractional RX gates, na hindi kasama ang RZZ gates.\n"
"Sa pamamagitan ng pagpapakilala ng custom decomposition rule, tulad ng ipinapakita sa sumusunod,\n"
"mababawasan natin ang bilang ng single-qubit gates na kinakailangan upang magpatupad ng U gate.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This feature is currently under discussion in this [GitHub "
"issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/13455).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang feature na ito ay kasalukuyang pinag-uusapan sa [GitHub "
"issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/13455) na ito.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we apply the transpiler using `constructor-beta` translation provided by `qiskit-basis-constructor` package.\n"
"As a result, the total number of gates is reduced compare to the previous transpilation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, ilalapat natin ang transpiler gamit ang `constructor-beta` translation na ibinigay ng `qiskit-basis-constructor` package.\n"
"Bilang resulta, ang kabuuang bilang ng gates ay nabawasan kumpara sa nakaraang transpilation.\n"

