# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As of Qiskit v2.0.3, there are known issues where RZZ gates with invalid angles may remain in the circuits even after transpilation.\n"
"The issue typically arises under the following conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Simula Qiskit v2.0.3, may mga kilalang isyu kung saan ang RZZ gates na may invalid angles ay maaaring manatili sa mga circuit kahit pagkatapos ng transpilation.\n"
"Ang isyu ay karaniwang lumilitaw sa ilalim ng mga sumusunod na kundisyon.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Failure when using `target` option with `generate_preset_pass_manager` or "
"`transpiler` {#failure-when-using-target-option-with-generate-preset-pass-"
"manager-or-transpiler}"
msgstr ""
"Pagkabigo kapag gumagamit ng `target` option sa "
"`generate_preset_pass_manager` o `transpiler` {#failure-when-using-target-"
"option-with-generate-preset-pass-manager-or-transpiler}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the `target` option is used with `generate_preset_pass_manager` or `transpiler`, the specialized transpiler pass `FoldRzzAngle` is not invoked.\n"
"To ensure proper handling of RZZ angles for fractional gates, we recommend always using the `backend` option instead.\n"
"See [this issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14318) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag ginagamit ang `target` option sa `generate_preset_pass_manager` o `transpiler`, ang specialized transpiler pass `FoldRzzAngle` ay hindi tinatawag.\n"
"Upang matiyak ang wastong paghawak ng RZZ angles para sa fractional gates, inirerekomenda namin na palaging gamitin ang `backend` option sa halip.\n"
"Tingnan ang [issue na ito](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14318) para sa higit pang detalye.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Failure when circuits contain certain gates {#failure-when-circuits-contain-"
"certain-gates}"
msgstr ""
"Pagkabigo kapag ang circuits ay naglalaman ng ilang gates {#failure-when-"
"circuits-contain-certain-gates}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If your circuit includes certain gates such as `XXPlusYYGate`, the Qiskit transpiler may generate RZZ gates with invalid angles.\n"
"If you encounter this issue, see this [GitHub issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/2256#issuecomment-2889487152) for a workaround.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung ang inyong circuit ay sumasaklaw ng ilang gates tulad ng `XXPlusYYGate`, ang Qiskit transpiler ay maaaring bumuo ng RZZ gates na may invalid angles.\n"
"Kung nakakatagpo kayo ng isyung ito, tingnan ang [GitHub issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/2256#issuecomment-2889487152) na ito para sa workaround.\n"

